    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40031" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιλήνιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽληνόσ̓</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>at a
			wine-press</i> or <i>the vintage</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Callix.
					2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕμνοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Anacreont.</u>
					57.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρχησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longus
					2.36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιλήνια χαίρειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					1.127
				</span></i>
			; epith. of Dionysus, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				50.1
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιλήναιοι</span></b> 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.Tyr.
					30.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιλήνιον, τό</span>,
				<i>commission on the</i>
			<i>vintage, PLond.ined.</i><i><span class="en">
				2135
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιλήνια, τά</span>, <i>vintage-festival</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.323
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFlor.</u>
				369.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
